Package: cybroid-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CybroidOS maintainers <citos@cybroid.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/cybroidinstitute/cit-os
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: cybroid-base (>= @VERSION@), cybroid-artwork (>= @VERSION@),
 xserver-xorg-core, xserver-xorg-input-libinput, x11-xserver-utils, xauth,
 lightdm, slick-greeter,
 xfce4-session, xfwm4, xfdesktop4, xfce4-panel, xfce4-settings, xfconf,
 thunar, xfce4-terminal, mousepad, xfce4-whiskermenu-plugin, xfce4-notifyd,
 xfce4-taskmanager, ristretto, xfce4-docklike-plugin,
 orchis-gtk-theme, papirus-icon-theme, fonts-inter, fonts-jetbrains-mono, fonts-dejavu-core,
 dbus-x11, dbus-user-session, polkitd, at-spi2-core, xdg-user-dirs,
 firefox-esr, xrdp, xorgxrdp
Replaces: citos-desktop (<< 0.1.2~)
Breaks: citos-desktop (<< 0.1.2~)
Description: CybroidOS Desktop Lite: Xfce with the CybroidOS look
 A light, modern desktop for servers and VMs: Xfce with a slim top bar
 (menu, clock, tray) and a dock, the Orchis dark theme, Papirus icons, the
 Inter and JetBrains Mono fonts, Firefox ESR, a terminal in CybroidOS colours,
 and slick-greeter's sign-in screen with the CybroidOS wallpaper and logo; xrdp
 lets Remote Desktop clients sign in. About 400 MB of memory when idle.
 These are defaults: each person can change them.
